        "id": "79ed0537-052f-4c91-a2f0-0be14190324c",
        "question": "Which system change caused the Atlas payment delay on March 3, which service was affected, and what confirmed the cause?",
        "status": "answered",
        "answer": "The Atlas payment delay on March 3 was caused by system change CHG-001, which reduced the database connection timeout from 2000 milliseconds to 250 milliseconds. [C1]\n\nThe affected service was payments-gateway. [C2]\n\nThe cause was confirmed by a verification note that documented how rolling back CHG-001 cleared the delay and replaying the workload with the change enabled reproduced the failures. [C3]",
